          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരിത്രകാരൻ — caritrakāran — \"a historian\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരിത്രകാരൻ ആ കോട്ടയെക്കുറിച്ച് ഒരു പുസ്തകം എഴുതി. caritrakāran ā kōṭṭayekkuṟiccŭ oru pustakaṁ eḻuti. The historian wrote a book about that fort."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരിത്രം, history, + -കാരൻ, one who works at it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരിത്രകാരൻ (caritrakāran) is built on ചരിത്രം (caritraṁ), \"history\", from Sanskrit caritra, \"going; behaviour\" (CDIAL 4691), with the ending -കാരൻ."
            }
          ]
        },
