              "text": "താളിയോല — tāḷiyōla — \"a palm-leaf manuscript\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗ്രന്ഥശാലയിൽ പഴയ താളിയോലകൾ സൂക്ഷിച്ചിരിക്കുന്നു. granthaśālayil paḻaya tāḷiyōlakaḷ sūkṣiccirikkunnu. Old palm-leaf manuscripts are kept in the library."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: താളിയോലകൾ, tāḷiyōlakaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before paper, books were written on such leaves."
